{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01LrrdgecbF9MsHfbyeUdZ5b","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All acceptance criteria verified:\n\n**AC1** - `-1i` flag prepends right-aligned inode numbers to each entry. Differential test `TestDiffInodeDisplay` covers this against gls.\n\n**AC2** - `-1s` flag prepends right-aligned 1K block counts with a `total` line. `-ls` produces a `total` line with block allocation sum in long format. Differential tests `TestDiffBlockDisplay` cover this.\n\n**AC3** - `-n --color=never` produces long-format output with numeric UID/GID (via `strconv.FormatUint`), not user/group name lookups. Differential test `TestDiffNumericIDs` covers this.\n\n**AC4** - `-1F --color=never` appends `/` for directories, `*` for executables, `@` for symlinks, `|` for pipes, and no indicator for regular files. Fixture creates all these file types. Differential test `TestDiffClassify` covers this.\n\n**AC5** - `golangci-lint run ./...` reports **0 issues** across all packages.\n\nFiles created/modified:\n- `cmd/ls/main.go` - Full ls implementation with core flags (prd008-ls) and extended metadata/classify flags (-i, -s, -n, -F per prd010-ls-extended R3, R4, R6.1, R6.5)\n- `cmd/ls/ls_test.go` - Differential tests for all new flags against gls reference binary\n- `go.mod`, `go.sum` - Module definition with golang.org/x/sys dependency\n- `pkg/sys/` - FileInfo struct, Stat/Lstat, TerminalWidth, IsTerminal, signal handlers (prd002-sys)\n- `pkg/format/` - Columns, PadRight/PadLeft, FileTypeColor, HumanSize (prd003-format)\n- `pkg/testutils/` - DiffTest, RunDiffTests, normalizers (prd001-testutils)"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":268,"cache_read_input_tokens":143547,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":268},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management